Package: RosettaGBR
Title: Translation Between Methods for Measuring COTS and Coral Cover on the Great Barrier Reef
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Dan", "Gladish", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "dan.gladish@csiro.au")
Description: Predicts one Great Barrier Reef monitoring measurement from
    another, with confidence and prediction intervals, through
    GBR_calibrate(). GBR_curve() returns the full calibration curve for a pair
    of tools and GBR_posterior() returns the fitted posterior draws. The tools
    covered are manta tow, ReefScan Surface, ReefScan Deep and eDNA, for coral
    cover (Beta regression) and Crown-of-Thorns Starfish counts and presence
    (Negative Binomial and Binomial regression), at tow, cull-site and reef
    level. Extends 'RosettaCOTS' (Foster, github.com/Scott-Foster/RosettaCOTS),
    which supports the site-level calibration models of CCIP D-02, with the
    multi-level models built for CCIP BR-04 (project RJFMP). The fitted
    posterior draws are bundled with the package; it does not fit models.
